    "html": "<p>A ball is thrown upwards at time t = 0. The graph shows the variation with time of the height of the ball. The ball returns to the initial height at time T.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the height h at time t ?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}gt^{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}gT^{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}gTT-t\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}gtT-t\"></span></li></ol>"
